Information related to the trusted list of v31null
24 October 2026

Pursuant to ETSI TS 119 612 V2.4.1 (2025-08), the v31null.de admin makes available to the public, through a secure channel to an authenticated web server, the information on the certification authorities operated by v31null, in a signed form suitable for automated processing.

This information is compiled and made available as a signed XML machine-processable form, called the ‘v31null trusted list’ (hereafter the ‘v31null TL’).

The authenticity and integrity of the v31null TL shall be verified by relying parties prior to any use.

The present publication details below where the v31null TL is made available (hereafter the ‘v31null TL location’) and which certificates support the signing of the v31null TL (hereafter the ‘v31null TL-signing certificates’).

The present publication is also made available at https://github.com/v31null/v31null.

