At the date of publication of the present document, the following applies:

The v31null TL location is the following URL: https://v31null.de/dss/ts_119612v020401p_5--Trusted_list.xml. Pursuant to Article 2(2) of Commission Implementing Decision (EU) 2015/1505, the publication is ensured both in a machine-processable form and in a human-readable form (PDF/A-1b) containing the same data, sealed with the electronic seal of v31null, at https://v31null.de/dss/ts_119612v020401p_5--Trusted_list.pdf.

